      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "{\u0022paragraphs\u0022:[[{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Keysight reported revenue of $1.85 billion for the quarter ended 2026-07-31, up 36.54% from a year earlier.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022GAAP net income for the quarter was $397 million.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The Communications Solutions Group supplied revenue of $1,345 million, up 43.09%, and its operating income rose to $458 million from $246 million.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Total segment operating income reached $613 million against $338 million a year earlier.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1}],[{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Management guided fourth-quarter revenue to a range of $1.93 billion to $1.95 billion.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022It guided non-GAAP earnings per share to $3.34 to $3.40 on a weighted diluted share count of about 172 million.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The midpoint of the revenue range represents year-over-year growth of approximately 37%.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Management said it is raising its outlook for the fourth quarter and for the full fiscal year.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The guidance came in well above the analyst consensus for both revenue and earnings per share.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:2},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Wireline revenue surpassed wireless revenue for the first time, which ties the growth to AI data centre investment.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:2}],[{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The main argument is over supply, because management said supply chain will remain the governor of near-term revenue.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The chief financial officer said demand is not the limiter, and that supply will govern how demand converts into revenue for the next several quarters.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022He also said one-time tariff impacts artificially lifted fiscal 2026 profitability and will not repeat.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:3},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Costs are rising quickly, with research and development at $312 million, up 24.8%, and selling, general and administrative expense at $446 million, up 25.99%.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The growth leans on the Communications Solutions Group, whose revenue rose 43.09% against 21.60% for the Electronic Industrial Solutions Group.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:1}],[{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Shares rose in pre-market trading after the results, which exceeded Wall Street expectations for both earnings and revenue.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:2},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022Analyst price targets sit above the share price, and current-year earnings estimates have been revised higher with none moving lower.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:5},{\u0022sentence\u0022:\u0022The same article cautions that price targets should be treated with a high degree of skepticism.\u0022,\u0022document\u0022:5}]]}"
